<h1>Whoops!</h1>
<h3>Someone already bought that item!</h3>

<p>An unfortunate sequence of events have just occurred:

<ol>
  <li><p>You opened or refreshed the wishlists page.</p></li>
  <li><p><%= original_purchaser.name %> indicated they bought <%= @item.name %> for <%= @item.user.name %>.</p></li>
  <li><p>You tried to indicate that <em>you</em> bought <%= @item.name %> for <%= @item.user.name %>.</p></li>
</ol>

<p><%= @item.user.name %> indicated they only want one of this item, so if you've actually bought it already then you'll either want to return it or contact <%= original_purchaser.name %> to see if they can return the <%= @item.name %> that they bought.</p>
